{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":9},"Les Chinois et Moi","En tant que producteur exécutif, parlant couramment le chinois, je m’occupe d’une équipe chinoise venue à Marseille tourner la deuxième saison de la série télévisée la plus populaire de Chine (150 Millions de téléspectateurs, un record absolu). Les Chinois et moi sera, à travers mon regard, le récit sensible et burlesque de la rencontre entre Marseillais et Chinois qui apprendront peu à peu à se connaître.",[4,5,6,7,8],"artistic creation","interracial relationships","urban","self-employment","superior-employee relationship",{"type":10,"id":11,"slug":12,"title":13,"release":15,"filmType":19,"directors":20,"genre":29,"media":33,"synopsis":36,"production":37,"characters":40,"roles":41,"awards":50,"tags":3},"Film","FR2019_092","fr2019-092-les-chinois-et-moi",{"native":1,"english":14},"",{"type":16,"date":17,"year":18},"Theatrical release","2019-05-15",2019,"Documentary",[21],{"id":22,"slug":23,"name":22,"birthYear":24,"deathYear":25,"gender":26,"nationality":27,"awards":28},"Renaud Cohen","renaud-cohen",1964,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[30,31,32],"Documentary – Performative mode","Documentary – Observational mode","Metacinema",{"posterUrl":34,"trailerUrl":35},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/174/34/205486/format_page/les-chinois-et-moi.png","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yf_pDXREK-8",{"native":2,"english":14},[38],{"country":27,"share":39},"Majority coproducer",[],[42,46],{"person":43,"role":45},{"id":22,"slug":23,"name":22,"birthYear":24,"deathYear":25,"gender":26,"nationality":27,"awards":44},[],"Director of the film",{"person":47,"role":49},{"id":22,"slug":23,"name":22,"birthYear":24,"deathYear":25,"gender":26,"nationality":27,"awards":48},[],"Documentary subject",[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
